#ASSERT `Was my action commenced in time` `PI` (D 1 4 2020) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE `any day` `an adult's birth date` TRUE (D 1 4 2020) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` `any day` FALSE `any day` TRUE (D 1 1 2030) `any day` EQUALS `INTIME`
