§§ `s 37A: the single publication rule`

#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) TRUE (D 1 3 2024) `an employee of the first publisher` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `FROMFIRST` (D 1 3 2022)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) TRUE (D 1 3 2024) `the first publisher` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `FROMFIRST` (D 1 3 2022)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) TRUE (D 1 3 2024) `an associated entity of the first publisher, or its employee or contractor` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `FROMFIRST` (D 1 3 2022)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) TRUE (D 1 3 2024) `the first publisher` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `FROMLATER` (D 1 3 2024)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) TRUE (D 1 3 2024) `someone else` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `FROMLATER` (D 1 3 2024)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) FALSE (D 1 3 2024) `the first publisher` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `FROMLATER` (D 1 3 2024)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 3 2022) TRUE (D 1 3 2024) `the first publisher` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `FROMLATER` (D 1 3 2024)
-- cl 5(3): a first publication before 1 July 2021 counts, for a later publication after it.
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 1 2020) TRUE (D 1 7 2021) `the first publisher` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `FROMFIRST` (D 1 1 2020)
#ASSERT `From when does my time run for a later publication` (D 1 1 2020) TRUE (D 30 6 2021) `the first publisher` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `NC37A`

