§§ `s 47: a time limit of less than twelve months in another law (arose 1 March 2024)`

#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 1 9 2024) `none of these` FALSE EQUALS `TWELVE` (D 1 3 2025)
#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 28 2 2025) `none of these` FALSE EQUALS `TWELVE` (D 1 3 2025)
#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 1 3 2025) `none of these` FALSE EQUALS `S47NOHELP`
#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 1 9 2024) `a criminal action` FALSE EQUALS `S47CRIM`
#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 1 9 2024) `an action to try the validity of an election or of title to an office` FALSE EQUALS `S47ELEC`
#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 1 9 2024) `an action to try the validity of an assessment, rate or loan made by or to a local government body` FALSE EQUALS `S47LG`
#ASSERT `Do I still have 12 months to sue` (D 1 3 2024) (D 1 9 2024) `none of these` TRUE EQUALS `S47ESS`

§§ `s 48: the court's power to extend (period ended 15 March 2023)`

`THIS ACT` MEANS `a limitation period in this Act, other than the one for an invalid tax`

#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` TRUE FALSE `any day` (D 15 3 2023) (D 1 4 2023) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48CRIM`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `the period for recovering an invalid tax (s 38(2))` FALSE TRUE (D 1 4 2023) (D 15 3 2023) (D 1 5 2023) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48TAX`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `a time limit in another Act, regulation, rule or by-law` FALSE FALSE `any day` (D 15 3 2023) (D 1 5 2023) FALSE FALSE EQUALS `S48OTHER`
-- Learnt 16 March 2022, inside the last twelve months; commenced 16 March 2023, twelve months after.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE TRUE (D 16 3 2022) (D 15 3 2023) (D 16 3 2023) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48YES`
-- Learnt 15 March 2022, exactly twelve months before the last day: not within.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE TRUE (D 15 3 2022) (D 15 3 2023) (D 16 3 2022) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48NOGROUND`
-- Learnt after the period ended (1 June 2023): commenced on 1 June 2024 in time, on 2 June 2024 not.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE TRUE (D 1 6 2023) (D 15 3 2023) (D 1 6 2024) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48YES`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE TRUE (D 1 6 2023) (D 15 3 2023) (D 2 6 2024) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48NOGROUND`
-- The defendant's conduct ground, but the court not satisfied it is just.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE FALSE `any day` (D 15 3 2023) (D 1 9 2023) TRUE FALSE EQUALS `S48NOTJUST`
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE FALSE `any day` (D 15 3 2023) (D 1 9 2023) TRUE TRUE EQUALS `S48YES`
-- A fact that is not material (s 48(3a)), with dates that would otherwise fit.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time` `THIS ACT` FALSE FALSE (D 16 3 2022) (D 15 3 2023) (D 16 3 2023) FALSE TRUE EQUALS `S48NOGROUND`

